acceptance_criteria: "The CLI exposes documented operational instance statistics and error diagnostics from the configured SearXNG service with validated TOON-default and JSON machine contracts; every command and subcommand has focused help with global flags; arbitrary search parameters, autocomplete, configuration discovery, setup, global state, and unlimited persistent caching retain full compatibility; repo-local @unbrained/pm-cli and project pm-changelog match registry latest; all source remains erasable type-safe TypeScript with 100/100/100/100 coverage and 100% module docstrings; full quality, security, package, installed npm/Bun consumer, live LAN, PM graph, GitHub review, merged-head, and daily auto-release gates pass"
definition_of_ready: "Complete historical PM state, live instance capabilities, official current SearXNG docs, current CLI behavior, and latest tool versions are verified before implementation."
goal: Full SearXNG CLI parity
objective: Agent-native operational and search workflows
value: "One private, scriptable CLI surface for search and instance diagnostics"
impact: Agents and CI can inspect and search the governed local service without browser-only gaps
outcome: Release-ready CLI with explicit live operational contracts
why_now: "The local instance exposes metrics/error surfaces not represented by intuitive CLI commands, and repo-local PM tooling trails the required latest version."
