plan_validation[1]{text,command,expected}:
  Local implementation and independent gates are green before commit.,"bun run test:coverage; lint/docs/duplicates/shell; bun audit; Trivy; history secret scan; package smoke; changelog checks; installed live E2E",938 tests and 100/100/100/100 coverage; zero high/critical vulnerabilities; npm and Bun package smoke; exact installed command uses governed LAN service and valid TOON/JSON outputs
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-24T21:01:26.960Z",codex-searxng-agent,Add instance stats and errors as explicit read-only commands with TOON default and JSON override; keep raw passthrough parameters as the complete search-feature contract.,This maps every stable programmatic upstream surface without scraping browser-only preference HTML into an unstable private schema.,Official Administration API documents /config; current general settings docs identify /stats and /stats/errors; the governed service returned HTTP 200 for all inspected routes.
plan_discoveries[2]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T21:01:26.165Z",codex-searxng-agent,"Live SearXNG 2026.7.22 exposes /config JSON, /autocompleter suggestions, /preferences and /stats HTML, and /stats/errors JSON. Existing CLI covers config and autocomplete but has no focused instance stats/errors command surface."
  "2026-07-24T21:18:36.053Z",codex-searxng-agent,The former bun-link acceptance path could resolve an older globally installed binary before the checkout build. Both live and release scripts now install the built package into an isolated temporary global prefix and assert exact executable resolution.
