body: "## Scope\\nComplete the stable SearXNG search and read-only operations surface through one cohesive CLI contract. Preserve the already shipped LAN routing, HTML fallback, TOON v4, setup wizard, global state, unlimited cache, SDK, formatter validation, and release guarantees.\\n\\n## Delivery\\nAdd stable instance operational commands, focused help, strict schemas/tests/docs, current PM packages, full live and installed acceptance, GitHub bot convergence, merge, and release proof."
